# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From physical experiment to quantum circuits {#from-physical-experiment-to-"
"quantum-circuits}"
msgstr ""
"Daripada eksperimen fizikal kepada litar kuantum {#from-physical-experiment-"
"to-quantum-circuits}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the operations of these gates, we can see, for example, that the kets in the expressions for $P_{++}$:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"are likely to involve a Hadamard gate to get the superposition, and a CNOT gate to create the entanglement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Daripada operasi get-get ini, kita boleh lihat, contohnya, bahawa ket-ket dalam ungkapan untuk $P_{++}$:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"berkemungkinan melibatkan get Hadamard untuk mendapat superposisi, dan get CNOT untuk mencipta keterjalin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will now use the H, X, and CNOT gates to turn $|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R$ "
"into "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan get H, X, dan CNOT untuk menukar "
"$|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R$ kepada "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}CNOT_{LR}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"Here $CNOT_{LR}$ means a CNOT gate using L as the control and R as the target. We can now factor out the R part of the state:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L-|1\\rangle_L\\right)|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}CNOT_{LR}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"Di sini $CNOT_{LR}$ bermaksud get CNOT menggunakan L sebagai kawalan dan R sebagai sasaran. Kita kini boleh faktorkan bahagian R keadaan:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L-|1\\rangle_L\\right)|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we have written the ket entirely as quantum gates operating on the "
"default starting state of the qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita telah menulis ket sepenuhnya sebagai get kuantum yang beroperasi "
"pada keadaan permulaan lalai qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we can use the $R_y(\\theta)$ acting on $\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle "
"0|_R\\langle 1|$ to obtain the bra in the expression for $P_{++}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kini boleh menggunakan $R_y(\\theta)$ yang bertindak pada "
"$\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle 0|_R\\langle 1|$ untuk mendapatkan bra dalam "
"ungkapan untuk $P_{++}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(\\cos(\\theta/2)\\langle0|+\\sin(\\theta/2)\\langle1|\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(|0\\rangle \\cos(\\theta/2)+|1\\rangle \\sin(\\theta/2)\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|\\left(R_{y,R}(\\theta)|0\\rangle_R\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(\\cos(\\theta/2)\\langle0|+\\sin(\\theta/2)\\langle1|\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(|0\\rangle \\cos(\\theta/2)+|1\\rangle \\sin(\\theta/2)\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|\\left(R_{y,R}(\\theta)|0\\rangle_R\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Combining these results, we can write the probability $P_{++}$ as\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan menggabungkan keputusan ini, kita boleh tulis kebarangkalian $P_{++}$"
" sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p_{++}=\\left|\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right|^2\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p_{++}=\\left|\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right|^2\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This gives us explicit instructions for how to construct our quantum "
"circuit. We will apply X, H, CNOT and $R_y$ gates to qubits representing the"
" quantum states of particles measured by Lucas and Rihanna, and make "
"measurements to obtain the probability.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini memberi kita arahan yang jelas tentang cara membina litar kuantum kita. "
"Kita akan menerapkan get X, H, CNOT dan $R_y$ pada qubit yang mewakili "
"keadaan kuantum zarah yang diukur oleh Lucas dan Rihanna, dan membuat "
"pengukuran untuk mendapatkan kebarangkalian.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum recommends tackling quantum computing problems using a framework we call Qiskit patterns. It consists of the following steps.\n"
"- Step 1: Map your problem to a quantum circuit\n"
"- Step 2: Optimize your circuit for running on real quantum hardware\n"
"- Step 3: Execute your job on IBM quantum computers using Runtime Primitives\n"
"- Step 4: Post-process the results\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum mengesyorkan menangani masalah pengkomputeran kuantum menggunakan rangka kerja yang kita panggil corak Qiskit. Ia terdiri daripada langkah-langkah berikut.\n"
"- Langkah 1: Petakan masalah Anda ke litar kuantum\n"
"- Langkah 2: Optimumkan litar Anda untuk dijalankan pada perkakasan kuantum sebenar\n"
"- Langkah 3: Laksanakan kerja Anda pada komputer kuantum IBM menggunakan Runtime Primitives\n"
"- Langkah 4: Proses semula keputusan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Basically all the work we did above was step 1. Let's build the resulting "
"circuit using Qiskit!\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada asasnya semua kerja yang kita buat di atas adalah langkah 1. Jom bina "
"litar yang dihasilkan menggunakan Qiskit!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
