# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we will use a Qiskit primitive called the StatevectorSampler. A sampler "
"is a primitive designed to sample all the possible states of a system and "
"return probabilities (or in some cases, quasiprobabilities) of obtaining "
"each state. We can specify a number of \"shots\", and look at the \"counts\""
" for each state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita akan menggunakan primitif Qiskit yang dipanggil "
"StatevectorSampler. Sampler adalah primitif yang direka untuk mengambil "
"sampel semua keadaan yang mungkin bagi suatu sistem dan memulangkan "
"kebarangkalian (atau dalam sesetengah kes, kuasai-kebarangkalian) untuk "
"mendapatkan setiap keadaan. Kita boleh menentukan bilangan \"shots\", dan "
"melihat \"counts\" untuk setiap keadaan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we look at the counts from each circuit, we see that two of them were "
