# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Critical concepts: {#critical-concepts}"
msgstr "Konsep kritikal: {#critical-concepts}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There was a historical disagreement about whether quantum states were merely"
" unknown or undetermined by nature prior to measurement, whether quantum "
"mechanics is deterministic or probabilistic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahulu terdapat pertikaian sejarah tentang sama ada keadaan kuantum hanyalah"
" tidak diketahui atau memang tidak ditentukan oleh alam semula jadi sebelum "
"pengukuran dilakukan, sama ada mekanik kuantum bersifat deterministik atau "
"probabilistik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Hidden variables and therefore local realism are not consistent with "
"observations of quantum mechanics. That is, the correlations observed in "
"quantum mechanics cannot be explained by well-defined variables that are "
"simply unknown to us.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pemboleh ubah tersembunyi dan oleh itu realisme lokal tidak konsisten dengan"
" pemerhatian mekanik kuantum. Maksudnya, korelasi yang diperhatikan dalam "
"mekanik kuantum tidak dapat dijelaskan oleh pemboleh ubah yang sudah pasti "
"tetapi hanya tidak diketahui oleh kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum mechanics is probabilistic.\n"
msgstr "Mekanik kuantum bersifat probabilistik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Entanglement is real and observable.\n"
msgstr "Keterjalin (entanglement) adalah nyata dan boleh diperhatikan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Entanglement is not just correlations.\n"
msgstr "Keterjalin bukan sekadar korelasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can map real world scenarios to quantum computers.\n"
msgstr "Kita boleh memetakan senario dunia nyata kepada komputer kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Hidden variables refers to quantities specified by nature, but unknown to "
"humans; they do not exist in this context.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pemboleh ubah tersembunyi merujuk kepada kuantiti yang ditentukan oleh alam "
"semula jadi tetapi tidak diketahui oleh manusia; ia tidak wujud dalam "
"konteks ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F questions: {#tf-questions}"
msgstr "Soalan B/S: {#tf-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Albert Einstein argued that quantum mechanics was incomplete, as a "
"theory, because it only described probabilities of outcomes, and not the "
"underlying mechanism that determined those outcomes.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Albert Einstein berhujah bahawa mekanik kuantum adalah tidak lengkap "
"sebagai satu teori kerana ia hanya menerangkan kebarangkalian hasil, bukan "
"mekanisme asas yang menentukan hasil tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F \"Hidden variables\" refers to the idea that two quantum mechanical "
"particles can be entangled.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S \"Pemboleh ubah tersembunyi\" merujuk kepada idea bahawa dua zarah "
"mekanik kuantum boleh saling terjalin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Any two correlated systems are quantum mechanically entangled.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Mana-mana dua sistem yang berkorelasi adalah saling terjalin secara "
"mekanik kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Quantum mechanical entanglement is important for getting math right, but"
" you can't see it in an experiment.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Keterjalin mekanik kuantum penting untuk mendapatkan matematik yang "
"betul, tetapi ia tidak dapat dilihat dalam eksperimen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F In most cases, quantum mechanics can't tell you an exact outcome of an "
"experiment, only the probabilities that certain outcomes will be measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Dalam kebanyakan kes, mekanik kuantum tidak dapat memberitahu Anda hasil"
" tepat sesuatu eksperimen, hanya kebarangkalian bahawa hasil tertentu akan "
"diukur.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F In quantum mechanics, under certain conditions, the state of particle A "
"can be affected by the state of particle B, even if particles A and B are "
"not in contact and do not exchange any particles.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Dalam mekanik kuantum, dalam keadaan tertentu, keadaan zarah A boleh "
"dipengaruhi oleh keadaan zarah B, walaupun zarah A dan B tidak bersentuhan "
"dan tidak bertukar sebarang zarah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F We can map real world experiments onto quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "B/S Kita boleh memetakan eksperimen dunia nyata kepada litar kuantum.\n"

